@startuml SEntity
title SEntity — State Machine

hide empty description

[*] --> Select

Select --> Wait : doSelect()\n/ selectBacklog()\n[SEntity does not self-schedule;\nTEntity drives all further events]

Wait --> Move : [TEntity departs src]\n/ scheduled by TEntity at src.transferEndTime

Move --> Delivered : [serial.deliveryNodeName == currNode]\n/ scheduled by TEntity at dst.transferEndTime
Move --> Select    : [serial.deliveryNodeName != currNode]\n/ scheduled by TEntity at dst.transferEndTime

Delivered --> [*]

note right of Wait
  SEntity never calls
  mySim.addEvent() for itself
  after joining a backlog.
  All state changes are
  driven by TEntity.
end note

@enduml
